      "SourceElementId": "G11-U04-L14-ACTIVITY-001",
      "SourceSection": "14.1: A Valid Solution?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "To solve the equation \\(5 \\boldcdot e^{3a} = 90\\), Lin wrote the following:",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u04-l14.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U04-L14-ACTIVITY-002",
      "SourceSection": "14.1: A Valid Solution?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "\\(\\displaystyle \\begin {align}5 \\boldcdot e^{3a} &= 90\\\\ e^{3a} &= 18\\\\ 3a &= \\log_e 18\\\\ a&=\\frac {\\log_e 18}{3}\\\\ \\end {align}\\)",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u04-l14.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
