    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U04-L14-ACTIVITY-005",
      "SourceSection": "14.2: Natural Logarithm",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Solve each equation by expressing the solution using \\(\\ln\\) notation. Then, find the approximate value of the solution using the “ln” button on a calculator.",
